{"id":"6159207e3a9c1add","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point.md","title":"条件归约的最小不动点","display":"thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point — 条件归约的最小不动点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point","aliases":["56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point — 条件归约的最小不动点","depends_on":["[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Exercise 3.5.6, printed p84","source_ocr_block":"105","verification_status":"local-proof-reviewed; source-exercise-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point — 条件归约的最小不动点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" href=\"?note=2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Exercise 3.5.6, printed p84"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"105"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; source-exercise-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定半等式条件系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_C,X_n,\\to_C\">\\(\\Phi_C,X_n,\\to_C\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" href=\"?note=2a8ab98bbdc29f05\" title=\"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step\">56-df-conditional-rewrite-step</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，所有规则条件列表有限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_n\\subseteq X_{n+1}),\\qquad\\Phi_C(\\to_C)=\\to_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_n\\subseteq X_{n+1}),\\qquad\\Phi_C(\\to_C)=\\to_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Y\\subseteq T^2\\;(\\Phi_C(Y)\\subseteq Y\\Longrightarrow\\to_C\\subseteq Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Y\\subseteq T^2\\;(\\Phi_C(Y)\\subseteq Y\\Longrightarrow\\to_C\\subseteq Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Exercise 3.5.6（印刷 p84，OCR 页块105）的半等式片段。证明：转换闭包对关系包含单调，故由空集开始分层递增。每次 Φ 的成员只有有限个条件，每个转换见证又仅用有限步，因此在并集上成立的条件都在某个共同有限层成立；由此 Φ 保持此递增并集，得到不动点。最后对 n 归纳得 X_n⊆Y。该段推导已在本笔记内给出，不是机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"2a8ab98bbdc29f05","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"2a8ab98bbdc29f05","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定半等式条件系统 $C$，令 $\\Phi_C,X_n,\\to_C$ 如 [[56-df-conditional-rewrite-step]]。$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，所有规则条件列表有限。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_C,X_n,\\to_C","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_n\\subseteq X_{n+1}),\\qquad\\Phi_C(\\to_C)=\\to_C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall Y\\subseteq T^2\\;(\\Phi_C(Y)\\subseteq Y\\Longrightarrow\\to_C\\subseteq Y).","display":true}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-conditional-rewrite-least-fixed-point.md]]"}],"outgoing":["2a8ab98bbdc29f05"]}